[00:38.64]Hand in hand with our dear Father,
[00:43.74]We would humbly walk with him each day.
[00:45.38]Oh, how undeserved his kindness
[00:52.78]That he grants to those who seek his way!
[00:54.70]By his love God made provision;
[00:56.20]We may freely take his hand.
[00:57.52]So we make our dedication;
[00:58.78]With Jehovah we take our stand.
[01:00.28]In this day of Satan’s anger,
[01:18.40]As the end is drawing ever near,
[01:22.64]We are faced with opposition
[01:24.18]That could make us turn away in fear.
[01:25.86]But Jehovah gives protection;
[01:27.30]Close to him we want to stay,
[01:27.80]That we might forever serve him.
[01:28.39]Love him loyally, never stray.
[01:28.94]Help for us God has provided
[01:29.46]Through his spirit and his written Word,
[01:30.21]Through the Christian congregation,
[01:30.92]Through assurance that our prayer is heard.
[01:31.74]As we’re walking with Jehovah,
[01:32.24]He will help us do what’s right.
[01:33.37]He will help us to be loyal
[01:34.35]And walk modestly in his sight.
